rong> with two exciting modes. Play in <strong>split-screen</strong> or crank up the intensity with <strong>Penalty Mode</strong>, where both players race on the same screen\u2014fall too far behind, and you're out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to master every track and push for the fastest lap times. Can you claim the top spot and become the ultimate Speed Rally champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in and start racing today!</p>","developers":["Horizont Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502370/5dd8285faba07eedfdcc781470e308b5d72f5ebb/header.jpg?t=1759873776","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Mac with Metal support (2012 or later)</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel i5</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/350